# 0.9.1: one line ending everywhere. Text files are LF in the repository AND in every checkout (also on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true), so FILELIST.sha256 matches what users install and diffs never show whole-file changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
# byte-for-byte originals: never touch (provenance hashes in vendor/original/*provenance.json)
vendor/** -text -diff
# binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.moc3 binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
